        concepts: '- Canonical Tag: Signals preferred URL when duplicate query strings exist.\n- Core Web Vitals: Loading speed (LCP), Interactivity (INP), Visual Stability (CLS).\n- E-E-A-T: Experience, Expertise, Authoritativeness, Trustworthiness.',
