        mcq: '1. Which HTML tag prevents duplicate query-string URLs from splitting search equity?\nA) <link rel="canonical" ...>  B) <br />  C) <meta viewport>  D) <strong>\nAnswer: A (Identifies the single authoritative source URL.)\n2. Which habit triggers Google Search manual or spam penalties?\nA) Buying networks of unnatural automated spam backlinks  B) Writing descriptive H2 subheadings  C) Adding alt text  D) Compressing images\nAnswer: A (Manipulative link schemes violate search quality policies.)',
